            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Johanna"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used lemon juice (since I had it on hand) rather than lemon slices, and added a bit of chilli.\n\nI was a little worried that this recipe would add too many strong flavours and would overwhelm the naturally strong taste of the fish, but it was just right: didn't try to mask the fishiness, but added some complimentary tastes. I broiled the fish for 6 minutes and it came out perfect! \n\nServed with (among other things) plain rice and the flavour of the fish was really taken up by the rice perfectly.",
            "datePublished": "2014-07-30T11:54:19.503Z"
          },
          {
