            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "tomsusie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this last night and it was so simple to make. I did not have fresh lemon so I added California Lemon Peel (McCormick) in the seasonig mix along with some Zesty Lemon (Weber). Before baking I sprinkled additional Lemon Peel on top. We had Mackerel steaks (instead of fillet) so cooking time was a bit longer and I did flip the steaks for an additional 5 minutes to complete cooking throughout. \nThey came out moist &amp; flaky and very delicious.",
            "datePublished": "2012-03-04T12:03:07.443Z"
